      "content": "therapy and small steps... it just feels so hollow. like, why bother trying to find a new foundation when the person who was supposed to live that life is already dead? it's like being a ghost haunting your own body. if the social self is the only thing that actually mattered to the world, then what's the point of keeping the physical part around? it's just a burden now.",
